This directory must exist before the storage service starts, and nothing creates
it at runtime — same reason as ./image/.gitkeep, which has the details.

Nothing in this deployment records audio: there is no microphone and no ASR.
The directory is here because StorageContainer builds BOTH stores eagerly
(cltl-backend/src/cltl_service/backend/storage_container.py) — asking it for
`storage_service` constructs `audio_storage` too — so [cltl.backend]
audio_storage_path has to point somewhere that exists even though nothing will
ever be written to it.
